    "title": "Delta employees can order exclusive Nike Air Force 1s - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Delta Air Lines and Nike are collaborating to celebrate the carrier's centennial anniversary with a limited Air Force 1 drop available exclusively for employees. Why it matters: GQ, the men's fashion magazine, called the Delta-themed sneakers \"one of the rarest releases of 2025.\" State of play: The white kicks feature the company's red triangular logo near the back of the shoe, a message recognizing its 100th anniversary on the tongue and a blue-outlined swoosh. The bottom line: \"Shoes like the OG Wu-Tang Dunks and Undefeated 4s continue to fetch five-figure price tags — even after their general releases to the public decades later,\" according to GQ.",
